<title>CANADA: Skyjack Inc Q2 net share profits jump.</title>
<headline>Skyjack Inc Q2 net share profits jump.</headline>
<dateline>GUELPH, Ontario 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Q2 ended Sept 30.</p>
<p>				1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			 C$0.47		   C$0.26</p>
<p> Net			  3,883		    2,105</p>
<p> Revs			50,006		   25,137</p>
<p>	    6 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			 C$0.97		   C$0.66</p>
<p> Net			  7,988		    5,395</p>
<p> Revs			97,467		   53,600</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note: Per share items all fully diluted. Q3 basic net income per share is C$0.48.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
